text": "आज के rupee जैसा metal या purchasing power मत मानना।", "size": 28, "x": 0.051, "y": 0.6338888888888888, "w": 0.8979999999999999, "h": 0.05222222222222222}, {"id": "association", "kind": "callout", "tone": "warm", "style": "note", "fill": "paper", "align": "center", "at": 1812, "until": 1891, "text": "Matching में association है, ‘केवल यही’ नहीं।", "size": 28, "x": 0.051, "y": 0.6338888888888888, "w": 0.8979999999999999, "h": 0.05222222222222222}, {"id": "spacing", "kind": "callout", "tone": "warm", "style": "note", "fill": "paper", "align": "center", "at": 1891, "until": 2072, "text": "बराबर gaps बराबर समय नहीं बताते।", "size": 28, "marks": [{"phrase": "बराबर समय नहीं", "at": 2034}], "x": 0.051, "y": 0.6338888888888888, "w": 0.8979999999999999, "h": 0.05222222222222222}], "touches": true, "cam": [{"at": 6, "box": {"x": 0.0, "y": 0.0, "w": 1.0, "h": 1.0}, "frames": 30}], "focus": [{"at": 427, "until": 562, "ids": ["anchor", "first", "punch_process"]}, {"at": 562, "until": 855, "ids": ["anchor", "second", "maurya_context"]}, {"at": 855, "until": 1262, "ids": ["anchor", "third", "die_process", "greek_context"]}, {"at": 1262, "until": 1518, "ids": ["anchor", "fourth", "gupta_context"]}, {"at": 1518, "until": 1785, "ids": ["anchor", "fifth", "suri_context", "modern_caution"]}, {"at": 2100, "until": 2130, "ids": ["anchor", "first"]}, {"at": 2130, "until": 2164, "ids": ["anchor", "second"]}, {"at": 2164, "until": 2215, "ids": ["anchor", "third"]}, {"at": 2215, "until": 2245, "ids": ["anchor", "fourth"]}, {"at": 2245, "until": 2296, "ids": ["anchor", "fifth"]}, {"at": 2296, "ids": ["anchor", "first", "second", "third", "fourth", "fifth"]}]}}], "camera": [{"at": 12, "box": {"x": 0.051, "y": 0.0, "w": 0.898, "h": 0.898}}], "captions": [{"at": 12, "until": 220, "text": "Indian coins की कतार कैसे पढ़ोगे? बाएँ से दाएँ, ऊपर समय या dynasty, नीचे जुड़ी coinage देखो।", "beat_id": "b21"}, {"at": 220, "until": 494, "text": "छोटे दबे निशान कैसे बने? Punch-marked में punch से निशान लगते हैं; पहला पड़ाव 6th c. BCE है, यानी छठी century, एक साल नहीं।", "beat_id": "b22"}, {"at": 494, "until": 806, "text": "अगला silver coin किससे जुड़ा है? Mauryan–Imperial silver, यानी empire से जुड़ी silver coinage; Mauryan को Ashoka की Maurya dynasty से पहचानो।", "beat_id": "b23"}, {"at": 806, "until": 1190, "text": "Design कैसे पड़ा? तीसरा Indo-Greek–Die-struck: design वाले die की चोट metal पर छाप छोड़ती है; यह technique है, metal नहीं। Indo-Greek उत्तर-पश्चिम में Greek-origin rulers थे।", "beat_id": "b24"}, {"at": 1190, "until": 1466, "text": "सोने के coins का नाम क्या है? चौथा Gupta–Gold dinars: dinar नाम के gold coins; Gupta को Chandragupta II की dynasty से जोड़ो।", "beat_id": "b25"}, {"at": 1466, "until": 1785, "text": "आखिरी silver coin का नाम? 1540 CE–Rupiya, Sher Shah Suri से जुड़ा standardized silver coin; आज के rupee जैसा metal या purchasing power मत मानना।", "beat_id": "b26"}, {"at": 1785, "until": 2072, "text": "Matching में association है, ‘केवल यही’ नहीं। बराबर gaps बराबर समय नहीं: century, dynasty और 1540 CE जैसा खास साल अलग labels हैं।", "beat_id": "b27"}, {"at": 2072, "until": 2393, "text": "क्रम याद रखो: Punch-marked, Mauryan silver, Indo-Greek Die-struck, Gupta dinars, 1540 का Rupiya; याद का सहारा: निशान, silver, technique, gold, Rupiya।", "beat_id": "b28"}]}, {"id": "v3_credits", "duration": 150, "layers": [{"id": "v3_credits_canvas", "type": "block", "block": "canvas_build", "at": 0, "box": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 1, "h": 1}, "data": {"theme": "paper", "elements": [{"id": "title", "kind": "text", "style": "title", "text": "Credits · श्रेय", "size": 48, "at": 6, "align": "center", "x": 0.051, "y": 0.08111111111111109, "w": 0.8979999999999999, "h": 0.05777777777777778}, {"id": "c0", "kind": "text", "style": "box", "text": "construction worker (tw:1f477) · Twitter, Inc and other contributors · CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/) · https://github.com/jdecked/twemoji", "size": 24, "at": 14, "align": "left", "x": 0.1268333333